{"setting":"babooshka","title":"Kate Bush · Babooshka","description":"The complete supplied double-bass and warrior-costume video: black veil and bodysuit, carved bass and neck grip, gold crown and costume, striped sleeves, backlight, instrument return and closing dance. Original music with actual mouth-engine vocals.","duration":211.07108843537415,"audio":"mix.mp3","characters":[{"id":"babooshka-kate","name":"Kate · the physical singer","role":"One source-timed physical singer shared by the veiled bassist and warrior costume","tele":"lead.tele","telemetryEncoding":"gzip"}],"cues":[{"start":20.92256,"end":23.575,"speaker":"babooshka-kate","text":"She wanted to test her husband","intensity":0.8},{"start":23.79589,"end":27.145,"speaker":"babooshka-kate","text":"She knew exactly what to do","intensity":0.8},{"start":27.83772,"end":30.29,"speaker":"babooshka-kate","text":"A pseudonym to fool him","intensity":0.8},{"start":30.66193,"end":34.14,"speaker":"babooshka-kate","text":"She couldn't have made a worse move","intensity":0.8},{"start":35.22364,"end":37.24,"speaker":"babooshka-kate","text":"She sent him scented letters","intensity":0.8},{"start":37.47609,"end":41.38,"speaker":"babooshka-kate","text":"And he received them with a strange delight","intensity":0.8},{"start":41.78654,"end":43.965,"speaker":"babooshka-kate","text":"Just like his wife","intensity":0.8},{"start":44.41567,"end":47.14767,"speaker":"babooshka-kate","text":"But how she was before the tears","intensity":0.8},{"start":47.15767,"end":53.21208,"speaker":"babooshka-kate","text":"And how she was before the years flew by","intensity":0.8},{"start":53.22208,"end":56.915,"speaker":"babooshka-kate","text":"And how she was when she was beautiful","intensity":0.8},{"start":58.24462,"end":59.86,"speaker":"babooshka-kate","text":"She signed the letter","intensity":0.8},{"start":60.19812,"end":61.035,"speaker":"babooshka-kate","text":"All yours","intensity":0.8},{"start":61.6016,"end":65.58,"speaker":"babooshk